===Cross Cloudford and catch up to the Trailblazer's squad{{subst:void|<!--102040206-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Cloudford|As you review the video communication sent by Kafka, you realize there is a hidden and lethal danger in her invitation &mdash; Her companion, the man named Blade, has an ancient and indelible feud with you.<br />You decide to go against the ban and set foot on the Luofu once again. Yet, when you land on Cloudford, you feel that Kafka was not lying. The Luofu has fallen into a catastrophe due to the influences of the Stellaron.}}
